1168+ 6B44
1169+ 6B44 BA               cp   d                 ; Compara platform_Y con calculated Y
1170+ 6B45 38 02            jr   c, .no_clamp      ; Se platform_Y < calculated Y, non limitare
1171+ 6B47
1172+ 6B47                  ; Altrimenti, limita a platform_Y
