   7+ 6F2D              ; Ciascun item occupa 5 byte:
   8+ 6F2D              ;   Byte 0: ID della stanza (0 = Test Room, 1 = The Bridge, 2 = The Off Licence, 3 = Master Bedroom, 4 = Under the MegaTree, 5 = At TheFoot The Mega Tree, 6 = The Drive, 7 = The Security Guard)
